automatically know private records,
current events, local policies, or

37
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.333
unstated intent. Ask whether relevant
evidence was supplied and whether

38
00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:24.667
the final answer accurately reflects it.
Fluent wording is an

39
